</section>
<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This paper proposes decentralized normalized stochastic gradient
descent for nonconvex optimization under the relaxed smoothness.
We provide theoretical analysis to show our method can achieve the <math id="S7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>-stationary point on each agent.
The empirical studies show that our method performs better than baselines.
In future work, we would like to establish decentralized methods for convex optimization under the relaxed smoothness <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">5</a>, <a href="#bib.bib12" title="" class="ltx_ref">12</a>, <a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">14</a>, <a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>, <a href="#bib.bib31" title="" class="ltx_ref">31</a>, <a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">46</a>]</cite>.
It is also interesting to extend our results to the more general assumption of symmetric relaxed smoothness <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">4</a>]</cite> and the stochastic gradient estimator with heavily tail-noise <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">30</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Some Technical Lemmas</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We first provide some technical lemmas for later proofs.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlem4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlem4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 4</span></span><span id="Thmlem4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib50" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ye et al. [50, Lemma 12]</a></cite>)<span id="Thmlem4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlem4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlem4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlem4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For given matrix <math id="Thmlem4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bf G}=[{\bf{g}}_{1};\dots;{\bf{g}}_{m}]\in{\mathbb{R}}^{m\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bf G}=[{\bf{g}}_{1};\dots;{\bf{g}}_{m}]\in{\mathbb{R}}^{m\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="Thmlem4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\bf G}-{\bf{1}}{\bar{\bf{g}}}\right\|^{2}\leq\left\|{\bf G}\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>𝟏</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\bf G}-{\bf{1}}{\bar{\bf{g}}}\right\|^{2}\leq\left\|{\bf G}\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="Thmlem4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bar{\bf{g}}}=\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}{\bf{g}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bar{\bf{g}}}=\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}{\bf{g}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlem5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlem5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 5</span></span><span id="Thmlem5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Li et al. [25, Lemma B.5]</a></cite>)<span id="Thmlem5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlem5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlem5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlem5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For given vectors <math id="Thmlem5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bf{v}}_{1},\dots,{\bf{v}}_{m}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{1\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bf{v}}_{1},\dots,{\bf{v}}_{m}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{1\times d}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlem5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bar{\bf{v}}}=\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}{\bf{v}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bar{\bf{v}}}=\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}{\bf{v}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}-\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|\leq\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}-{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}-\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|\leq\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}-{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">This result is presented in the analysis <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Li et al. [25, Lemma B.5]</a></cite>.
Here, we provide the detailed proof for completeness. We have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}-\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}-\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex24.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{(\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|){\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{(\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|){\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex25.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\left\|\frac{(\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|){\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\left\|\frac{(\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|){\bf{v}}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex26.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}_{i}\right\|\right|\,\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}_{i}\right\|\right|\,\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex27.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\right|}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left|\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|-\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|\right|}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex28"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex28.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}-{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}-{\bf{v}}_{i}\right\|}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}\right\|},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the first inequality is based on vector AM-QM inequality; the second inequality is based on Cauchy–Schwarz inequality; the last step is based on the triangle inequality.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlem6" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlem6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 6</span></span><span id="Thmlem6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlem6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlem6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlem6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The update of Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> implies <math id="Thmlem6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">This result can be obtained by following <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">Luo et al. [33, Lemma 2]</a></cite>. Here, we provide the detailed proof for completeness.
The update in line <a href="#alg2.l4" title="In Algorithm 2 ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> and Proposition <a href="#Thmprop2" title="Proposition 2 ( [ , Proposition 1] ). ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> imply <math id="A1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{0}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{0}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math>. Suppose it holds <math id="A1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, then the update in line <a href="#alg2.l10" title="In Algorithm 2 ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> means</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx28" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex29"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t+1}=\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}({\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}+{\bf{g}}_{i}^{t+1}-{\bf{g}}_{i}^{t})={\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}+{\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t+1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t+1}=\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}({\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}+{\bf{g}}_{i}^{t+1}-{\bf{g}}_{i}^{t})={\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}+{\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{g}}}^{t+1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, we finish the proof by induction.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlem7" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlem7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 7</span></span><span id="Thmlem7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib53" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al. [53, Appendix A.1]</a></cite>)<span id="Thmlem7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlem7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlem7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlem7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under Assumptions <a href="#Thmasm2" title="Assumption 2 (relaxed smoothness). ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <a href="#Thmasm3" title="Assumption 3 (bounded gradient dissimilarity). ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx29" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f({\bf{y}})\leq f({\bf{x}})+\left\langle\nabla f({\bf{x}}),{\bf{y}}-{\bf{x}}\right\rangle+\frac{L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|}{2}\left\|{\bf{y}}-{\bf{x}}\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f({\bf{y}})\leq f({\bf{x}})+\left\langle\nabla f({\bf{x}}),{\bf{y}}-{\bf{x}}\right\rangle+\frac{L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|}{2}\left\|{\bf{y}}-{\bf{x}}\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlem7.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlem7.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">for all <math id="Thmlem7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bf{x}},{\bf{y}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bf{x}},{\bf{y}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="Thmlem7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\bf{y}}-{\bf{x}}\right\|\leq 1/L_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\bf{y}}-{\bf{x}}\right\|\leq 1/L_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">Proposition <a href="#Thmprop1" title="Proposition 1. ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> means the objective <math id="A1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(L_{f},L_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(L_{f},L_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>-smooth,
then applying equation (29) of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib53" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al. [53, Appendix A.1]</a></cite> directly achieves equation (<a href="#A1.E7" title="In Lemma 7 ( [ , Appendix A.1] ). ‣ Appendix A Some Technical Lemmas ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>).
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>The Proof of Proposition <a href="#Thmprop1" title="Proposition 1. ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">For all <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bf{x}},{\bf{y}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bf{x}},{\bf{y}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|\leq 1/L_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|\leq 1/L_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx30" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex30"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})-\nabla f({\bf{y}})\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})-\nabla f({\bf{y}})\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex31.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\big(\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})-\nabla f_{i}({\bf{y}})\big)\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\big(\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})-\nabla f_{i}({\bf{y}})\big)\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex32.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\left\|\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})-\nabla f_{i}({\bf{y}})\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\left\|\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})-\nabla f_{i}({\bf{y}})\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex33.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}(L_{0}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})\right\|)^{2}\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}(L_{0}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})\right\|)^{2}\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex34.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(L_{0}+L_{1}(\left\|\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})-\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|+\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|))^{2}\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(L_{0}+L_{1}(\left\|\nabla f_{i}({\bf{x}})-\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|+\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|))^{2}\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex35.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(L_{0}+L_{1}\zeta+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|)^{2}\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(L_{0}+L_{1}\zeta+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bf{x}})\right\|)^{2}\left\|{\bf{x}}-{\bf{y}}\right\|^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the first inequality is based on the Young’s inequality; the second inequality is based on Assumption <a href="#Thmasm2" title="Assumption 2 (relaxed smoothness). ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>; the third inequality is based on Assumption <a href="#Thmasm3" title="Assumption 3 (bounded gradient dissimilarity). ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.
Therefore, the function <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(L_{f},L_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(L_{f},L_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>-smooth with <math id="A2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{f}=L_{0}+L_{1}\zeta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ζ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{f}=L_{0}+L_{1}\zeta</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>The Proof of Lemma <a href="#Thmlem1" title="Lemma 1. ‣ 4 The Complexity Analysis ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We first provide the upper bound for the difference of mean vectors <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlem8" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlem8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 8</span></span><span id="Thmlem8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlem8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlem8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlem8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the setting of Theorem <a href="#Thmthm1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, we have
<math id="Thmlem8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|^{2}\leq\eta^{2}\leq 1/(4L_{1}^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|^{2}\leq\eta^{2}\leq 1/(4L_{1}^{2})</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">The updates in lines <a href="#alg2.l6" title="In Algorithm 2 ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> and <a href="#alg2.l7" title="In Algorithm 2 ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> of Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> imply</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx31" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E8.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}-\eta{\bar{\bf{u}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}-\eta\cdot\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}\right\|}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐮</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}-\eta{\bar{\bf{u}}}^{t}={\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}-\eta\cdot\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}\right\|},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the first step is based on Proposition <a href="#Thmprop2" title="Proposition 2 ( [ , Proposition 1] ). ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. Therefore, we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|^{2}=\eta^{2}\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}\right\|}\right\|^{2}\leq\frac{\eta^{2}}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\left\|\frac{{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}\right\|}\right\|^{2}=\eta^{2}\leq\frac{1}{4L_{1}^{2}},\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|^{2}=\eta^{2}\left\|\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}\right\|}\right\|^{2}\leq\frac{\eta^{2}}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\left\|\frac{{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}\right\|}\right\|^{2}=\eta^{2}\leq\frac{1}{4L_{1}^{2}},\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">where the first inequality is based on the vector AM-QM inequality and the last step is based on the setting of <math id="A3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta=\min\left\{\epsilon/(4L_{f}+1),1/(2L_{1})\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta=\min\left\{\epsilon/(4L_{f}+1),1/(2L_{1})\right\}</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We then connect the gradient <math id="A3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})</annotation></semantics></math> as follows.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlem9" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlem9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 9</span></span><span id="Thmlem9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlem9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlem9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlem9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the setting of Theorem <a href="#Thmthm1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 3 The Algorithm and Main Results ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})\right\|\leq L_{f}\eta+\left(1+L_{1}\eta\right)\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})\right\|\leq L_{f}\eta+\left(1+L_{1}\eta\right)\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">We have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx34" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})\right\|\\
\leq&amp;\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})-\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|+\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
\leq&amp;\left(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\right)\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|+\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
\leq&amp;\left(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\right)\eta+\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
=&amp;L_{f}\eta+\left(1+L_{1}\eta\right)\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|,\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>≤</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>≤</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>≤</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})\right\|\\
\leq&amp;\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})-\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|+\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
\leq&amp;\left(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\right)\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|+\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
\leq&amp;\left(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\right)\eta+\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
=&amp;L_{f}\eta+\left(1+L_{1}\eta\right)\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|,\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the first step is based on triangle inequality;
the second step is based on Proposition <a href="#Thmprop1" title="Proposition 1. ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>;
and third last step is based on Lemma <a href="#Thmlem8" title="Lemma 8. ‣ Appendix C The Proof of Lemma ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Now we present the proof of Lemma <a href="#Thmlem1" title="Lemma 1. ‣ 4 The Complexity Analysis ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A3.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Applying Lemmas <a href="#Thmlem7" title="Lemma 7 ( [ , Appendix A.1] ). ‣ Appendix A Some Technical Lemmas ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, <a href="#Thmlem8" title="Lemma 8. ‣ Appendix C The Proof of Lemma ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> and <a href="#Thmlem9" title="Lemma 9. ‣ Appendix C The Proof of Lemma ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx35" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\small\begin{split}&amp;f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1})-f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\\
\overset{~(\ref{eq:smooth-descent})~}{\leq}&amp;\left\langle\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}),{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\rangle+\frac{L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|}{2}\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|^{2}\\
\overset{(\ref{eq:bx-eta})}{\leq}&amp;\left\langle\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t},{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\rangle+\left\langle{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t},{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\rangle+\frac{\eta^{2}}{2}(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|)\\
\overset{~(\ref{eq:diff-bar-x})~}{\leq}&amp;\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|\left\|{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t+1}-{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|-\eta\left\langle{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t},\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}\right\|}\right\rangle+\frac{\eta^{2}}{2}(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|)\\
\overset{(\ref{eq:bx-eta})}{\leq}&amp;\eta\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|+\eta\left\langle{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t},\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|}-\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|}-\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}\right\|}\right\rangle+\frac{\eta^{2}}{2}(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|)\\
~=~&amp;\eta\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|-\eta\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|+\eta\left\langle{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t},\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|}-\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}\right\|}\right\rangle+\frac{\eta^{2}}{2}(L_{f}+L_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|)\\
~\leq~&amp;\eta\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|-\eta\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|+\eta\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|\left\|\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|}-\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}\right\|}\right\|+\frac{\eta^{2}L_{f}}{2}+\frac{\eta^{2}L_{1}}{2}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
~\leq~&amp;\eta\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|+\eta(\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|-\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|)\\
&amp;+\eta\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|\left\|\frac{{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}}{\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|}-\frac{1}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\frac{{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}}{\left\|{\bf{v}}_{i}^{t}\right\|}\right\|+\frac{\eta^{2}L_{f}}{2}+\frac{\eta^{2}L_{1}}{2}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\\
\overset{~(\ref{eq:consensus-error-1})~}{\leq}&amp;2\eta\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|-\eta\left(1-\frac{\eta L_{1}}{2}\right)\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|+\frac{\eta}{m}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\left\|{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}-{\bf{v}}^{t}_{i}\right\|+\frac{\eta^{2}L_{f}}{2}\\
~\leq~&amp;2\eta\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})-{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|-\eta\left(1-\frac{\eta L_{1}}{2}\right)\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|+\frac{\eta}{\sqrt{m}}\left\|{\bf V}^{t}-{\bf{1}}{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|+\frac{\eta^{2}L_{f}}{2},\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mover accent="true"><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.630em" minsize="0.630em">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.630em"><a href="#A1.E7" title="In Lemma 7 ( [ , Appendix A.1] ). ‣ Appendix A Some Technical Lemmas ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:63%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a></mtext><mo maxsize="0.630em" minsize="0.630em">)</mo></mrow></mover></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mover accent="true"><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.630em" minsize="0.630em">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.630em"><a href="#A3.E9" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C The Proof of Lemma ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:63%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a></mtext><mo maxsize="0.630em" minsize="0.630em">)</mo></mrow></mover></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mover accent="true"><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.630em" minsize="0.630em">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.630em"><a href="#A3.E8" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C The Proof of Lemma ‣ Decentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:63%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a></mtext><mo maxsize="0.630em" minsize="0.630em">)</mo></mrow></mover></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><