\sqrt{m}}\left(M_{0}+M_{1}\left\|\nabla f({\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t})\right\|\right)\left\|{\bf X}^{t}-{\bf{1}}{\bar{\bf{x}}}^{t}\right\|+\frac{2\eta}{\sqrt{m}}\left\|{\bf V}^{t}-{\bf{1}}{\bar{\bf{v}}}^{t}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
